msgid "Getting it ready…"
msgstr "Připravuje se…"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7565
msgid ""
"It couldn't be installed. Check the internet connection, then try again."
msgstr ""
"Nepodařilo se to nainstalovat. Zkontrolujte připojení k internetu a zkuste to znovu."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7566
msgid ""
"Windows key + Alt + G keeps the last 30 seconds on screen in Videos. The first time, choose the screen to record."
msgstr ""
"Klávesa Windows + Alt + G uloží posledních 30 sekund obrazovky do Videí. Poprvé zvolte obrazovku, která se má nahrávat."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7579 linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7722 linux/libexec/monet-quick:6621
msgid "Shared with Windows"
msgstr "Sdíleno s Windows"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7591 linux/libexec/monet-quick:4142
msgid "Windows games"
msgstr "Hry pro Windows"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7592
msgid "Install each game once"
msgstr "Každou hru instalujte jen jednou"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7593
msgid ""
"Windows didn't shut down fully, so its drive isn't open to Monet this time. It is again after your next trip to Windows."
msgstr ""
"Windows se úplně nevypnul, takže jeho disk tentokrát není pro Monet otevřený. Po vaší příští návštěvě Windows už bude."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7594
msgid ""
"Windows wants to check its drive first. It does that by itself the next time it starts."
msgstr ""
"Windows chce nejprve zkontrolovat svůj disk. Udělá to sám při příštím spuštění."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7596
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is encrypted with BitLocker. Start Windows once, and Monet Bridge hands its recovery key over: Monet opens it by itself from then on. Or type the key here."
msgstr ""
"Disk Windows je šifrovaný nástrojem BitLocker. Jednou spusťte Windows a Monet Bridge předá jeho obnovovací klíč: Monet ho od té doby otevírá sám. Nebo klíč napište sem."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7597
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is encrypted with BitLocker. Type its recovery key once, and Monet opens it at every start, for games, files and Wi-Fi in both."
msgstr ""
"Disk Windows je zašifrovaný nástrojem BitLocker. Zadejte jednou jeho obnovovací klíč a Monet ho otevře při každém spuštění, pro hry, soubory a Wi-Fi v obou."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7598
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is open. Monet Bridge installs itself the next time Windows starts, and from then on games, files and Wi-Fi work in both."
msgstr ""
"Disk Windows je otevřený. Monet Bridge se nainstaluje sám při příštím spuštění Windows a od té doby hry, soubory a Wi-Fi fungují v obou."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7599
msgid "Windows' drive couldn't be opened this time."
msgstr "Disk Windows se tentokrát nepodařilo otevřít."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7600
msgid ""
"Steam here and Steam in Windows both play from it. When you install a game, choose Windows games, and it's ready on both."
msgstr ""
"Steam tady i Steam ve Windows hrají odtud. Při instalaci hry zvolte „Windows games“ a bude připravená na obou stranách."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7601
msgid ""
"Steam here can keep games in Windows' Games folder, where Windows plays them too. Steam closes for a moment to add it."
msgstr ""
"Steam tady může ukládat hry do složky Games ve Windows, kde je hraje i Windows. Steam se na chvíli zavře, aby ji přidal."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7602
msgid ""
"Steam keeps games for both in Windows' Games folder for the person who set up this PC."
msgstr ""
"Steam ukládá hry pro oba systémy do složky Games ve Windows, pro toho, kdo tento počítač nastavil."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7638
msgid "Recovery key, 48 digits"
msgstr "Obnovovací klíč, 48 číslic"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7644
msgid "Unlocking…"
msgstr "Odemykání…"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7644
msgid "Unlock"
msgstr "Odemknout"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7652
msgid ""
"It's in your Microsoft account, or in Windows: search for Manage BitLocker, then Back up your recovery key."
msgstr ""
"Najdete ho ve svém účtu Microsoft, nebo ve Windows: vyhledejte Spravovat BitLocker a pak Zálohovat obnovovací klíč."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7659
msgid "Find my key"
msgstr "Najít můj klíč"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7667 linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7674 setup/monet_setup/app.py:50
msgid "Epic and GOG games"
msgstr "Hry z obchodů Epic a GOG"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7668
msgid ""
"In Heroic, choose Windows games as the folder when you install one, and Windows plays it too: Epic's launcher there takes it over, and GOG's games start by themselves."
msgstr ""
"V Heroicu při instalaci hry zvolte složku „Windows games“ a Windows ji bude hrát také: spouštěč Epic ji tam převezme a hry z GOG se spustí samy."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7675
msgid ""
